297
00:16:34,849 --> 00:16:36,350
Bale is mine.

298
00:16:36,434 --> 00:16:40,313
[♪ upbeat music playing]

299
00:16:40,396 --> 00:16:41,856
[trilling]

300
00:16:50,990 --> 00:16:52,033
[whirring]

