Ah, come on.

439
00:27:12,319 --> 00:27:13,528
Just go.

440
00:27:14,988 --> 00:27:16,406
Hey there, spy.

441
00:27:18,867 --> 00:27:20,118
Don't you die.

442
00:27:23,205 --> 00:27:24,289
[scoffs]

443
00:27:26,249 --> 00:27:28,877
[♪ soft tense music playing]

444
00:27:48,772 --> 00:27:49,815
[door opens]

445
00:27:49,898 --> 00:27:51,316
[door closes]

446
00:27:51,400 --> 00:27:53,110
[soft thudding]

447
00:28:16,299 --> 00:28:17,843
[doors close]

448
00:28:19,886 --> 00:28:20,887
[sighs] Pasin,

449
00:28:20,971 --> 00:28:22,431
head on over to Jian.

450
00:28:22,514 --> 00:28:25,434
Minhye can't handle Kuma and his team
on her own, so give her a hand.

451
00:28:33,275 --> 00:28:34,317
Jinman.

452
