457
00:29:07,100 --> 00:29:09,102
Cheolseung has reached his first position.

458
00:29:09,186 --> 00:29:10,353
[sighs]

459
00:29:23,200 --> 00:29:26,411
[whirring]

460
00:29:31,875 --> 00:29:32,876
[grunts]

461
00:29:41,593 --> 00:29:42,594
[soft click]

462
00:29:43,762 --> 00:29:44,888
Ah, ah.

463
00:29:48,558 --> 00:29:49,559
Bale.

464
00:29:50,685 --> 00:29:52,395
You're going to Hell today.

465
00:29:57,067 --> 00:29:58,568
[clicking]

466
00:29:58,652 --> 00:30:00,529
[beeping]
STYLE
::cue()

