-He entered at 0900 hours.

488
00:31:30,994 --> 00:31:33,121
He's back,
but there's no record of him leaving.

489
00:31:33,205 --> 00:31:35,332
[sighs] This is such a hassle. Shit.

490
00:31:37,250 --> 00:31:38,793
I'm sorry.

491
00:31:38,877 --> 00:31:40,337
Let me just check one thing.

492
00:31:41,171 --> 00:31:42,881
Call whoever was on duty this morning.

493
00:31:44,299 --> 00:31:46,009
[keyboard clacking]

494
00:31:46,092 --> 00:31:48,053
-[beeping]
-[line rings]

495
00:31:52,349 --> 00:31:53,683
[line ringing continues]

496
00:31:57,646 --> 00:31:58,855
[line ringing continues]

497
00:31:58,939 --> 00:32:00,065
Why isn't he picking up?

498
00:32:00,148 --> 00:32:01,149
Damn idiot.

499
00:32:01,775 --> 00:32:02,776
Yeah.

500
00:32:02,859 --> 00:32:04,152
Hey, this is the main gate.

501
00:32:04,236 --> 00:32:07,322
Where was Team Leader Three
this morning after about 0900?

502
00:32:09,783 --> 00:32:14,746
Ah, he was… at the firing range
at 1200, I believe.

503
00:32:14,829 --> 00:32:16,498
Got it. Here.

504
00:32:18,667 --> 00:32:19,918
[door opens]

505
00:32:21,544 --> 00:32:22,879
[door closes]

506
