with the password verification.

511
00:32:55,829 --> 00:32:58,832
Hey, he's already been through today.

512
00:33:00,041 --> 00:33:01,668
I'm sorry about this. Truly.

513
00:33:01,751 --> 00:33:03,753
Uh, it's protocol, so I have to do it.

514
00:33:03,837 --> 00:33:04,963
[guard] Phoenix.

515
00:33:06,881 --> 00:33:10,302
[♪ suspenseful music playing]

516
00:33:10,385 --> 00:33:12,929
Password, password, password.

517
00:33:13,013 --> 00:33:14,097
