518
00:33:14,180 --> 00:33:15,473
These Babylon assholes.

519
00:33:15,557 --> 00:33:17,225
I've never done this before.

520
00:33:21,187 --> 00:33:24,065
[♪ tense music playing]

521
00:33:24,149 --> 00:33:26,192
What's the stupid password? Shit.

522
00:33:27,152 --> 00:33:28,945
I told you to open it.

523
00:33:29,029 --> 00:33:30,905
I'm just following the procedure here.

524
00:33:30,989 --> 00:33:32,240
It's all right.

525
00:33:34,993 --> 00:33:35,994
Rifle.

526
